/-!
# Preparations for excluding the opposite orientation in MS93 (4.4.1)

The opposite marking gives genuine contragredient coordinates on the actual
WB_c/B_c. A parabolic fixing U_c has zero fixed space on this quotient. The
two escape contradictions have also been proved with their exact critical
pairs and path-distance premises.

The remaining arguments are selection of the initial edge and centralizer,
the forward continuations and their generated endpoint commutator group, and
the backward displacement identity. Source.lean retains their selected
witnesses as explicit intermediate contracts. This module does not yet assert
SameOrientation from the source hypotheses; final assembly must construct
and discharge those contracts.

Source: Meierfrankenfeld--Stellmacher (1993), (4.4.1), pp.890--891.
-/
